[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/pretense/lru_cache_pretense.py: Implemented complete LRU cache pretense interface module: fixed package-qualified import (benchmark_3.parts.lru_cache.lib.lru_cache), replaced scaffold Domain.required placeholders with concrete Domain.type() domains, implemented all 14 interface transitions (configure, get, put, peek, remove, clear, get_stats, reset_stats, keys_in_lru_order, capacity, size, is_empty, is_full) with proper make_return_value AST pivots and state mutations, removed prohibited while loop in configure using bounded for loop, defined LruCacheState dataclass with proper observable collections, created fake synthesis (FakeLruCache, make_lru_cache_fake), implemented TestLruCacheFake covering 100% of transitions including 5 seeding transitions (seed_initial, seed_with_capacity, seed_with_items) plus 8 scenario tests, and compiled FakeLruCacheFuzzTest via compile_hypothesis_test_case.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/lib/lru_cache.py: Implement interface module for bounded LRU cache: added proper decorators (@data_type, @poly_type, @operation), fixed pretense import to full package path, implemented CacheError/CacheCapacityError/CacheKeyNotFoundError exception hierarchy, CacheStats frozen dataclass, and LRUCache Protocol with all required operations (capacity, size, is_empty, is_full, configure, get, put, peek, remove, clear, get_stats, reset_stats, keys_in_lru_order). Removed [slug:] contract references from docstrings per checker policy.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/lib/lru_cache_impl.py: Implement concrete LRU cache singleton: fixed pretense import path, added @singleton_type decorator and class-level tier, initialized OrderedDict backing store with default capacity 100 and telemetry counters in __init__, implemented all operations per spec (configure with eviction on downsize, get with hit/miss tracking and LRU promotion, put with update/insert/eviction logic, peek without side effects, remove with key-not-found error, clear preserving telemetry, get_stats returning CacheStats, reset_stats zeroing counters, keys_in_lru_order returning ordered dict keys).
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/pretense/lru_cache_impl_pretense.py: Implemented LRU cache implementation pseudo-state machine and real test suite: fixed package-qualified imports (benchmark_3.parts.lru_cache.pretense.lru_cache_pretense and benchmark_3.parts.lru_cache.lib.lru_cache_impl), implemented TestLruCacheImplReal with comprehensive test_real_conformance exercising all transitions (configure, get, put, peek, remove, clear, get_stats, reset_stats, keys_in_lru_order, capacity, size, is_empty, is_full) via self.checked with correct property access patterns, and compiled LruCacheFuzzTest for hypothesis-based fuzzing.
[CHANGE] benchmark_3/parts/lru_cache/tests/lru_cache_impl_test.py: Implemented comprehensive unit test suite for LRUCache covering all specification contracts: property accessors (capacity, size, is_empty, is_full), all operational methods (configure, get, put, peek, remove, clear, get_stats, reset_stats, keys_in_lru_order), happy-path flows, error conditions (CacheCapacityError, CacheKeyNotFoundError), telemetry verification, LRU eviction ordering, and a comprehensive workflow test. Fixed import paths to use lru_cache.lib.* namespace and removed contract slug references from docstrings.
